% 🎞️ The renderer iterator: preorder over every node with x, y, r, x0/x1/y0/y1,
% depth, height, value, id and parent bound; the body sees the index as #1.
\cs_new_protected:Npn \semio_viz_hierarchy_map_nodes:nn #1#2 {
